 journalofmanagementstudies.ac.uk/special-issue-call-for-papers-truth-and-
 organizations-in-the-age-of-polarization/\nSeeks work at any level and wi
 th any method on how truth is contested and made consequential in and aro
 und organizations\, including credibility\, expertise\, whistleblowing\, 
